<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Feeding on the husks around me,</l><l>Till my strength was almost gone,</l><l>Longed my soul for something better,</l><l>Only still to hunger on.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Poor I was, and sought for riches,</l><l>Something that would satisfy,</l><l>But the dust I gathered round me</l><l>Only mocked my soul’s sad cry.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Well of water, ever springing,</l><l>Bread of life, so rich and free,</l><l>Untold wealth that never faileth,</l><l>My Redeemer is to me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
